      <title>汤家凤呼吁英语退出考研主科：工具定位下权重该如何重排</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260905/%E6%B1%A4%E5%AE%B6%E5%87%A4%E5%91%BC%E5%90%81%E8%8B%B1%E8%AF%AD%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E8%80%83%E7%A0%94%E4%B8%BB%E7%A7%91%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%83%E9%87%8D%E8%AF%A5%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%87%8D%E6%8E%92/</link>
